  'AI platform for K-12 educators with 80+ tools for lesson planning, assessment creation, IEP drafting, and student feedback - FERPA and COPPA compliant.', 'MagicSchool is an AI platform for K-12 educators founded in 2023 by Adeel Khan, a former teacher and assistant principal, in Denver, Colorado. The platform offers over 80 AI-powered tools designed specifically for teachers, covering lesson planning, standards-aligned assessments, IEP generation, differentiated instruction, rubric creation, and student communication drafts. MagicSchool is trusted by over 5.5 million educators and has raised $65.3 million in funding. It is FERPA, COPPA, SOC 2, and GDPR compliant, and student data is never sold or used to train AI models.', 'https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=magicschool.ai&sz=256',
